    "text": "COMPLIANCE:\nScene ID: SC_001_007\nAllowed events: Artie and Fizz encounter a slime, Artie is terrified of taking 1 damage, Artie kicks the slime, the slime is vaporized by a massive critical hit, a loot drop is left behind.\nForbidden milestones: Acquiring the Participation Trophy (happens in 1:8).\nCurrent arm-side / inventory facts: Leather Wallet (stowed, pocket_right), Employee ID Badge (equipped, neck_lanyard).\n\nAPPEARANCE_CHECK:\n- CHAR_ARTIE: muddy brown eyes, skinny-fat, pale, cheap leather loafers\n- CHAR_FIZZ: neon pink hair, digital blue eyes, ethereal form\n\nPROSE:\nArtie and Fizz hit the grass of the Tutorial Forest spawn point, immediately stumbling into a gelatinous blue slime that squelched forward to initiate an encounter. The digital canopy above filtered low-resolution sunlight over the aggressive dessert as it jiggled menacingly. \n\n\"Welcome to the combat tutorial!\" Fizz cheered, her tiny ethereal form doing a loop in the air. Her neon pink hair flared brightly. \"Please engage the hostile fauna to proceed.\"\n\nArtie backed away rapidly, his cheap leather loafers slipping on the pixelated dirt. His pale, skinny-fat frame was rigid with absolute terror. He clutched his Employee ID Badge dangling from its neck lanyard like a protective talisman, his right hand hovering near the pocket holding his Leather Wallet. \n\n`[Target: Basic Slime (Lvl. 1) - HP: 10/10]`\n\n\"Fizz, I have one hit point,\" Artie hissed, his muddy brown eyes wide with panic. \n\n`[Artie - HP: 1/1]`\n\n\"It's a basic slime,\" Fizz sighed, her digital blue eyes rolling. \"It does one point of damage. Just kick it. You literally can't miss.\"\n\n\"One point of damage is my entire life bar!\" Artie shrieked. The slime pulsed, a red telegraph rectangle appearing on the ground directly at his feet. \n\nWith nowhere left to retreat, Artie squeezed his eyes shut, let out a pathetic battle cry, and swung his right foot in a frantic, uncoordinated punt. His scuffed shoe connected with the jiggling mass.\n\n`[Critical Hit!]`\n\nThe sound of the impact was deafening\u2014a digital thunderclap that rattled Artie's teeth and shook the surrounding pine trees. A massive shockwave of distorted kinetic energy erupted from the point of contact.\n\n`[Damage: 99,999]`\n\nThe massive red numbers clipped through the tree branches, hanging in the sky like an apocalyptic warning. \n\n`[Target Defeated.]`\n\n`[Experience Gained: 5 XP]`\n\nArtie opened his eyes. The slime was completely vaporized. The physics engine had simply deleted it from reality, unable to process the math of the absurd critical hit multiplier. Where the slime had been, a smoking crater remained, and hovering in the center was a small, golden loot drop spinning slowly on an invisible axis. \n\nFizz floated down, her jaw hanging open. \"Well. That's one way to clear a tutorial.\"\n\nSTATE_PATCH:\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"world_updates\": {\n    \"cast_present\": [\n      \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n      \"CHAR_FIZZ\"\n    ],\n    \"location\": \"LOC_TUTORIAL_FOREST\",\n    \"open_threads\": [\n      \"THREAD_GLITCH\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"character_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"character_id\": \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n      \"chapter\": 1,\n      \"scene\": 7,\n      \"inventory\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": \"ITEM_wallet\",\n          \"container\": \"pocket_right\",\n          \"status\": \"stowed\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": \"ITEM_employee_id\",\n          \"container\": \"neck_lanyard\",\n          \"status\": \"equipped\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"containers\": [\n        {\n          \"container\": \"pocket_right\",\n          \"owner\": \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n          \"contents\": [\n            \"ITEM_wallet\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"container\": \"neck_lanyard\",\n          \"owner\": \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n          \"contents\": [\n            \"ITEM_employee_id\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"invariants_add\": [],\n      \"persona_updates\": [\n        \"Artie realizes his 100% Critical Hit Rate makes him absurdly destructive, but he remains terrified of taking any damage.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"character_id\": \"CHAR_FIZZ\",\n      \"chapter\": 1,\n      \"scene\": 7,\n      \"inventory\": [],\n      \"containers\": [],\n      \"invariants_add\": [],\n      \"persona_updates\": [\n        \"Fizz is stunned by the destructive potential of Artie's glitched stats.\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"character_continuity_system_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"character_id\": \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n      \"set\": {\n        \"resources\": {\n          \"xp\": {\n            \"current\": 5\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"reason\": \"Gained 5 XP from defeating the basic slime.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary_update\": {\n    \"last_scene\": [\n      \"Artie and Fizz encountered a basic slime in the Tutorial Forest.\",\n      \"Terrified of his 1 HP limit, Artie kicked the slime in a panic.\",\n      \"The attack triggered a massive critical hit that dealt 99,999 damage, vaporizing the slime and leaving behind a golden loot drop.\"\n    ],\n    \"key_events\": [\n      \"Artie and Fizz encountered a basic slime in the Tutorial Forest.\",\n      \"Artie panicked over his 1 HP limit and kicked the slime.\",\n      \"The kick resulted in a massive critical hit dealing 99,999 damage.\",\n      \"The slime was vaporized, leaving behind a golden loot drop.\",\n      \"Artie gained 5 XP from the encounter.\"\n    ],\n    \"must_stay_true\": [\n      \"inventory: CHAR_ARTIE -> Leather Wallet (status=stowed, container=pocket_right)\",\n      \"inventory: CHAR_ARTIE -> Employee ID Badge (status=equipped, container=neck_lanyard)\",\n      \"container: pocket_right (owner=CHAR_ARTIE, contents=[ITEM_wallet])\",\n      \"container: neck_lanyard (owner=CHAR_ARTIE, contents=[ITEM_employee_id])\",\n      \"Artie has 1/1 HP, 10/10 Stamina, and a 100% Critical Hit Rate.\",\n      \"Artie has 5/100 